      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The psychological well being of the patient and the patient's entire family is critically important to successful rehabilitation of individuals with multiple sclerosis (MS). This article deals with the psychotherapeutic management and problems faced by the person with MS, including fatigue, chronic pain, stressful life events, and cognitive defects."},
